# .trivyignore
#
# Findings accepted for the Trivy scans in
# .github/workflows/docs-build.yml, gate.yml and release.yml. Format: `<id> exp:YYYY-MM-DD`, with the
# reason in a comment above each entry.
#
# Accepted exceptions are listed below.

# DS-0002 (docker/Dockerfile has no USER): deliberate. The container starts as
# root only so /entrypoint.sh can repair the data volume ownership, then drops
# to rctapi (10001:10001) with `exec gosu`; the server never runs as root.
DS-0002 exp:2027-05-09
